  "description": "QueryServiceClient is a library for .NET Framework 4.5.2 that simplifies database operations by providing a lightweight client for performing CRUD (Create, Read, Update, Delete) operations on mapped entities. It allows developers to interact with MySQL databases using an object-based approach, generating dynamic SQL queries from .NET classes.",
